WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.400
Akuma’s Drive Impact counters Ryu’s attempt.

2
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:04.850
Back heavy kick launches Ryu after the short approach.

3
00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:05.400
Light Gou Hadoken keeps the opponent airborne.

4
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:05.900
Akuma uses raw Drive Rush to follow the fireball.

5
00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:06.900
Standing heavy punch catches Ryu from the Rush.

6
00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:07.950
Medium Tatsu continues the juggle.

7
00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:09.150
Light Gou Shoryuken adds a final hit after medium Tatsu reaches the corner.

8
00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:09.850
Ryu recovers in the corner after the Shoryuken ender.
